    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d79f3dc722eacddea5adc76a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那间神社能结出这么美味的柿子……\r\n一定是个好地方！\r\n好～我也来帮忙～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb5d0927e93565165db2e7d2039d8dbca0a8070332bb0a2e25d56f89324b3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249016c771eb1921d7fe97d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情享受夏日吧――呜哇！？\r\n啊哇哇ー！？…哇～～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f941d594a04993e2defab4ebe3416389d6d26a09a74bbd5298ac3961e660d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af7c6c14c212c5e11a26248e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n听说撒年糕仪式大受好评呢。\r\n耶嘿嘿，我也好想快点吃到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d51f6dd4b2d4f7b1cb156f1358f5fd02d8ebdcb5ec6806056d289506cb65018",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c38eac8df9eb8e9dc9d5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年糕汤、年菜跟矶边烧\r\n真素好好吃呗～！\r\n这下我今年也能好好加油啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbba456bedae9b21c5a3f9ca5db278f41890c9975727f4ea048eabbeb38addf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4170412ff2ea12239b71a5d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为“日本第一赛马娘”，\r\n这场比赛、这次对决――我会赢！\r\n呀啊啊啊啊～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98770e141a9274e8419ade000add095c0a2eb0969760875cc0520a2ce60107a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "40005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec10da56881e4335b69219ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为“日本第一赛马娘”，\r\n这场比赛、这次对决――我会赢！\r\n呀啊啊啊啊～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98770e141a9274e8419ade000add095c0a2eb0969760875cc0520a2ce60107a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
