      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcd5b06ba16c59cc79ca06ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸、呼～…我、我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b4a6c8a4da1b5c295e0a9d7ad1ea391b483ccfdc3ca36f8558f89caf9e7b4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcc60207c0ac37d695ee35b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与训练员一起，成为日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa350524180bce2f113f6f61cd37c335e31ffd7ef0ff26f33150de40bd151971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c2b9c9b725f87a73119d0f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『成为日本第一的赛马娘』\r\n究竟指的是什么…\r\n我终于明白了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1f86a9f57c8b1f0eb3b439355abdfd0cc852e1c3942f1919d5763a0cdcf5c98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d1a2dad984627d97cebf67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直都憧憬着特雷森学园的制服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "439be8db7e999c80c6d7858609b64809d766c0a3b4be2f09bc99391228f2014f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a10077a219f44f98af4d15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，这身合适我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c59ea3de0b96e8c0ef83dea4c6643611a1f83e2ea19a1c3c36a473a7baa76f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17cc62013981a1e61525b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本第一的赛马娘——特别周！诶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "090657e02c9fba6948b7923edea5ba636bc1a8685155749d201ff8b832b370f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b34b41a880b20d93f016bbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，看着像城里的赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd436bda1f21b3dde92fefbcaaeb78d7eb9846846db2ea061e3838e82530b79f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b45c393f8376cf398ab6ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可爱的衣服呐～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36df99cff42cd89f938266c86df60477a7b180420f47d295dd9437477dd55b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:327d35470b214a477fabfb6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？能成为人气第1吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1e5078d71c8b10409352c8f1871a0173d7b1d678ea79d8ae7f0f94c71b1d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2194d896db349ec78d36dfc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能穿着这么可爱的泳装什么的…\r\n诶嘿嘿，好害羞啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "616933e5dbc9b50a9e6449f1d27bd976cfda51c3dfa1925bdb0bfd56b356b661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbe07af944d313086de8193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是看着就好像能闻到\r\n太阳的味道呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b512dc6e8505623d437c4bd771664596dc8d2ca02e8529186bb3d321464e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e179758cd9100fd221ca0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35cc1a1f563cceb56e50e212087077488890e63d45a72418e3f5b7376f0de6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
